          "id": "EXT-02-K03-check-q1",
          "type": "single",
          "question": "已知二阶矩阵 A 的行列式 det(A) = 0，关于线性方程组 Ax = b 的解，下列说法正确的是：",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "A",
              "label": "方程组必有唯一解"
            },
            {
              "value": "B",
              "label": "方程组必无解"
            },
            {
              "value": "C",
              "label": "矩阵 A 不可逆，方程组不可能有唯一解"
            },
            {
              "value": "D",
              "label": "矩阵 A 可逆，方程组必有唯一解"
            }
          ],
          "answer": [
            "C"
          ],
          "analysis": "det(A) = 0 表明矩阵 A 不可逆，因此无法通过 x = A⁻¹b 求解。此时线性方程组 Ax = b 不可能有唯一解，可能无解，也可能有无穷多解，取决于 b 是否位于 A 的列空间中。",
          "points": 10,
          "knowledgePointIds": [
            "EXT-02-K03"
          ],
          "cognitiveLevel": "understand",
          "estimatedSteps": 2,
          "pairId": "EXT-02-K03-check-pair",
          "adaptiveRole": "core",
          "equivalence": {
            "presentationMode": "text-symbol",
            "knownConditionCount": 1,
            "operationCount": 1,
